# m6_retry: the RETRY shield in a normal game. m2_play's input (the sweep to 3960 with its two
# holds), the ship idle after 3960, plus RIGHT 5150..5200. Re-pinned for M7: the sweep cannot
# live through stage 1 in a normal game, so it collects the shield in god mode (debug_god at
# 31; god never consumes the shield) and god goes off again at 5000, in the Heisenbug's fight
# (no hit lands in the 200 ticks before, so every rewind replays from a god-free keyframe).
# - 2429: the retry crate (crate 6 of the sequence) is grabbed, shield 0 -> 1.
# - 5126 (game tick 5019): the idle ship is hit with the shield up. The shield takes it inside
#   the simulation: shield 1 -> 0, state stays 1 (PLAYING, no REWIND), rewinds stay 3, fuel
#   180 untouched (m6_retry_hc shows the fuel side where a hit would cost it), and 60 ticks
#   of invulnerability.
# - RIGHT 5150..5200 flies the ship into the boss: rammed at 5207 (tick 5100), an unshielded
#   hit, so a normal one: REWIND, rewinds 3 -> 2, target 4980 (hit - 120). During the playback
#   the world goes back past the absorbing hit, so at 5267 (tick 5018) the shield is up again;
#   the resume at 5287 (tick 4980) keeps it and charges the M7 power loss (F5 -> F4, forks
#   2 -> 1, mercy 80). The idle ship then meets the boss's fire again and the shield absorbs
#   it at 5347 (tick 5040; not the same tick as before, since the weaker ship changes the
#   fight), rewinds still 2. The next real hit is at 5599 (rewinds 1).
# debug_history_check is 0 right after the absorbing hit, through the invulnerability and
# after the resume (2 on the bug-report frames, 5207..5226, by design).
--frames 5700 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "5000 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_shield,debug_rewinds,debug_fuel,debug_lives --at "2428 debug_shield == 0" --at "2429 debug_shield == 1" --at "5125 debug_shield == 1" --at "5125 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "5126 debug_game_tick == 5019" --at "5126 debug_shield == 0" --at "5126 debug_state == 1" --at "5126 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "5126 debug_fuel == 180" --at "5127 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5160 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5206 debug_state == 1" --at "5206 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "5206 debug_lives == 3" --at "5207 debug_state == 4" --at "5207 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "5207 debug_rewind_target == 4980" --at "5266 debug_shield == 0" --at "5267 debug_shield == 1" --at "5287 debug_state == 1" --at "5287 debug_game_tick == 4980" --at "5287 debug_shield == 1" --at "5287 debug_weapon == 4" --at "5287 debug_forks == 1" --at "5287 debug_mercy == 80" --at "5300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5346 debug_shield == 1" --at "5347 debug_shield == 0" --at "5347 debug_state == 1" --at "5347 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "5350 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5598 debug_state == 1" --at "5599 debug_state == 4" --at "5599 debug_rewinds == 1" --expect "debug_rewinds == 1"
